# docker/gitea's live container state (bind-mounted, unlike vaultwarden/mediawiki
# which use named Docker volumes living outside the repo tree entirely) -
# includes a JWT signing private key, an SSH host private key, the SQLite DB,
# and app.ini (which carries an auto-generated SECRET_KEY/INTERNAL_TOKEN).
docker/gitea/data/
docker/gitea/config/

# Self-signed TLS cert/key for the local docker-test stack - regenerated by
